<strong><span style="color: #00cfff;"> Manpower in UAE</span></strong></h2>
</div></div><div class="wpb_text_column us_custom_4f955a91 has_text_color"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><p>Delivering exceptional Manpower in Dubai to our valued customers, enabling them to achieve their business objectives.</p>
</div></div><div class="w-btn-wrapper default_align_left laptops_align_right tablets_align_right mobiles_align_center"><a class="w-btn us-btn-style_3" target="_blank" href="/about-us/" rel="noopener"><span class="w-btn-label">About Us</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section  class="l-section wpb_row us_custom_41b180c8 height_medium"><div class="l-section-h i-cf"><div class="g-cols vc_row via_grid cols_3 laptops-cols_inherit tablets-cols_inherit mobiles-cols_1 valign_top type_default stacking_default"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="w-iconbox us_custom_add3fd8d has_text_color iconpos_top style_default color_primary align_center icontype_img"><div class="w-iconbox-icon" style="font-size:3.8rem;"><img decoding="async" width="63" height="73" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2063%2073'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="space vector" data-lazy-src="https://ngmanpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Vector.png" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="63" height="73" src="https://ngmanpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Vector.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="space vector" /></noscript></div><div class="w-iconbox-meta"><h4 class="w-iconbox-title">We are Govt Authorized</h4><div class="w-iconbox-text"><p>We are proud to be approved and authorized by the Ministry of Human Resources and Emiratization, UAE. Additionally, we are licensed by the Department of Economic Development to carry out the Business of Labor Supply all over the UAE.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="w-iconbox us_custom_add3fd8d has_text_color iconpos_top style_default color_primary align_center icontype_img"><div class="w-iconbox-icon" style="font-size:3.8rem;"><img decoding="async" width="63" height="73" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2063%2073'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="space vector" data-lazy-src="https://ngmanpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Vector.png" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="63" height="73" src="https://ngmanpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Vector.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="space vector" /></noscript></div><div class="w-iconbox-meta"><h4 class="w-iconbox-title">Trained Manpower Supply</h4><div class="w-iconbox-text"><p>We understand that every business has unique requirements. Our team of experts works closely with you to provide customized manpower UAE that perfectly fit your needs, ensuring optimal productivity and efficiency.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="w-iconbox us_custom_add3fd8d has_text_color iconpos_top style_default color_primary align_center icontype_img"><div class="w-iconbox-icon" style="font-size:3.8rem;"><img decoding="async" width="63" height="73" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2063%2073'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="space vector" data-lazy-src="https://ngmanpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Vector.png" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="63" height="73" src="https://ngmanpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Vector.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="space vector" /></noscript></div><div class="w-iconbox-meta"><h4 class="w-iconbox-title">Time and Cost Savings</h4><div class="w-iconbox-text"><p>With the help of <span data-sheets-root="1" data-sheets-value="{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;manpower outsourcing company&quot;}" data-sheets-userformat="{&quot;2&quot;:266941,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:&#091;{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}&#093;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:&#091;{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}&#093;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:&#091;{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}&#093;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:&#091;{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}&#093;},&quot;10&quot;: