</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section  class="l-section wpb_row us_custom_41b180c8 height_medium"><div class="l-section-h i-cf"><div class="g-cols vc_row via_grid cols_2 laptops-cols_inherit tablets-cols_inherit mobiles-cols_1 valign_top type_default stacking_default"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="w-iconbox us_custom_add3fd8d has_text_color iconpos_top style_default color_primary align_center icontype_img"><div class="w-iconbox-icon" style="font-size:3.8rem;"><img decoding="async" width="63" height="73" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2063%2073'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="space vector" data-lazy-src="https://ngmanpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Vector.png" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="63" height="73" src="https://ngmanpower.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Vector.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="space vector" /></noscript></div><div class="w-iconbox-meta"><h4 class="w-iconbox-title">Flexible Contracts</h4><div class="w-iconbox-text"><p>At NG Manpower, we prioritize Flexible Contracts in all our operations. We adhere to strict protocols and guidelines to create a safe working environment for our employees and clients.</p>
